<title>GERMANY: Thomson TV Germany closes Hanover plants.</title>
<headline>Thomson TV Germany closes Hanover plants.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomson Television Germany GmbH said on Tuesday its supervisory board had agreed with a management plan to end production in Hanover and the nearby town of Celle.</p>
<p>The long-expected decision, which unions had protested in the last two months, would put 150 workers in Hanover and 650 in Celle out of work, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
</text>
